<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Mahmut Ar\u0131kan Kayseri\u2019ye geliyor! Tarih ve yer belli oldu","articleSection":"G\u00fcndem","dateCreated":"2026-08-27T10:35:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-08-27T10:35:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-08-27T12:13:56+03:00","wordCount":502,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/mahmut-arikan-kayseriye-geliyor-tarih-yer-belli"},"articleBody":"Saadet Partisi\u2019nin 8. Ola\u011fan Kocasinan Kongresi, Genel Ba\u015fkan Mahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla Kayseri\u2019de ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek. \u201cKocasinan i\u00e7in b\u00fct\u00fcn g\u00fcc\u00fcm\u00fczle\u201d slogan\u0131yla d\u00fczenlenecek kongre, 28 A\u011fustos 2026 Cuma g\u00fcn\u00fc saat 19.30\u2019da \u0130l K\u00fclt\u00fcr M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc Konferans Salonu\u2019nda yap\u0131lacak.\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Kocasinan Kongresi D\u00fczenlenecek\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Kayseri te\u015fkilat\u0131, Kocasinan il\u00e7esinde ola\u011fan kongreye haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor. Partinin 8. Ola\u011fan Kocasinan Kongresi i\u00e7in tarih, saat ve yer bilgileri payla\u015f\u0131ld\u0131.\r\n\r\n\u201cKocasinan i\u00e7in b\u00fct\u00fcn g\u00fcc\u00fcm\u00fczle\u201d slogan\u0131n\u0131n kullan\u0131laca\u011f\u0131 kongre, 28 A\u011fustos 2026 Cuma g\u00fcn\u00fc ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek. Program, saat 19.30\u2019da ba\u015flayacak. Kongrenin adresi ise \u0130l K\u00fclt\u00fcr M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc Konferans Salonu olacak.\r\n\r\nMahmut Ar\u0131kan Kongreye Kat\u0131lacak\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi 8. Ola\u011fan Kocasinan Kongresi\u2019ne Genel Ba\u015fkan Mahmut Ar\u0131kan da kat\u0131lacak. Kongreye ili\u015fkin yay\u0131mlanan davette program\u0131n, Genel Ba\u015fkan Mahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n te\u015frifleriyle ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilece\u011fi belirtildi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n kat\u0131laca\u011f\u0131 programda Saadet Partisi\u2019nin Kocasinan\u2019daki 8. Ola\u011fan Kongresi yap\u0131lacak. Kongrenin ana slogan\u0131 ise \u201cKocasinan i\u00e7in b\u00fct\u00fcn g\u00fcc\u00fcm\u00fczle\u201d olarak a\u00e7\u0131kland\u0131.\r\n\r\nErdal Altun\u2019dan Bas\u0131n Mensuplar\u0131na Davet\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Kayseri \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Erdal Altun, 8. Ola\u011fan Kocasinan Kongresi dolay\u0131s\u0131yla bas\u0131n mensuplar\u0131na davette bulundu. Altun, Genel Ba\u015fkan Mahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek kongrede bas\u0131n mensuplar\u0131n\u0131 da aralar\u0131nda g\u00f6rmekten onur duyaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ifade etti.\r\n\r\nKayseri \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Erdal Altun\u2019un davet mesaj\u0131nda \u015fu ifadeler yer ald\u0131:\r\n\r\n\u201cGenel Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z Say\u0131n Mahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n te\u015frifleriyle ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirece\u011fimiz 8. Ola\u011fan Kocasinan Kongremizde, siz de\u011ferli bas\u0131n mensuplar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 da aram\u0131zda g\u00f6rmekten onur duyar\u0131m.\u201d\r\n\r\nKongrenin Tarihi Ve Saati Belli Oldu\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Kocasinan 8. Ola\u011fan Kongresi, 28 A\u011fustos 2026 Cuma g\u00fcn\u00fc d\u00fczenlenecek. Saat 19.30\u2019da ba\u015flayacak kongreye \u0130l K\u00fclt\u00fcr M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc Konferans Salonu ev sahipli\u011fi yapacak.\r\n\r\nGenel Ba\u015fkan Mahmut Ar\u0131kan\u2019\u0131n kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek program i\u00e7in Saadet Partisi Kayseri \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Erdal Altun taraf\u0131ndan bas\u0131n mensuplar\u0131na davet yap\u0131ld\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Kocasinan Kongresi Nerede Yap\u0131lacak?\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi\u2019nin 8. Ola\u011fan Kocasinan Kongresi, Kayseri\u2019de bulunan \u0130l K\u00fclt\u00fcr M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc Konferans Salonu\u2019nda ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek. Kongre, 28 A\u011fustos 2026 Cuma g\u00fcn\u00fc saat 19.30\u2019da ba\u015flayacak.\r\n\r\n\u201cKocasinan i\u00e7in b\u00fct\u00fcn g\u00fcc\u00fcm\u00fczle\u201d slogan\u0131yla yap\u0131lacak programa Saadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan kat\u0131lacak. Saadet Partisi Kayseri \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Erdal Altun da kongre \u00f6ncesinde yay\u0131mlad\u0131\u011f\u0131 mesajla bas\u0131n mensuplar\u0131n\u0131 programa davet etti.\r\n\r\nKongre Program\u0131\r\n\r\nTarih: 28 A\u011fustos 2026 Cuma\r\n\r\nSaat: 19.30\r\n\r\nYer: \u0130l K\u00fclt\u00fcr M\u00fcd\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc Konferans Salonu\r\n\r\nProgram: Saadet Partisi 8. Ola\u011fan Kocasinan Kongresi","description":"Saadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan, 28 A\u011fustos\u2019ta Kayseri\u2019de d\u00fczenlenecek 8. Ola\u011fan Kocasinan Kongresi\u2019ne kat\u0131lacak.","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/kayserihabercom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/kayserihaber-com\/uploads\/2026\/08\/2026\/08\/mahmut-arikan-kayseri-1.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Mahmut Ar\u0131kan Kayseri\u2019ye geliyor! Tarih ve yer belli oldu"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/#organization","name":"Kayseri Haber","image":"https:\/\/kayserihabercom.teimg.com\/kayserihaber-com\/uploads\/2026\/05\/logolar\/kayseri-haber-logo2.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/kayserihabercom.teimg.com\/kayserihaber-com\/uploads\/2026\/05\/logolar\/kayseri-haber-logo2.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"D\u00f6nd\u00fc Nur Demir","url":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"D\u00f6nd\u00fc Nur \u00d6z\u00e7elik","url":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/muhabir\/71\/dondu-nur-ozcelik"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com\/#organization","name":"Kayseri Haber","url":"https:\/\/www.kayserihaber.com"}}</script>


